      "places": [
        "composer/composer.json: config.classmap-authoritative"
      ],
      "lines": [
        "The Composer autoloader is optimized beyond level 1. The manual allows only config.optimize-autoloader: an authoritative class map breaks the upgrade of the app, and APCu is no required extension.",
        "  composer/composer.json: config.classmap-authoritative"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "time-direct",
      "level": "info",
      "places": [
        "lib/Controller/ProfileApiController.php:98 new DateTimeImmutable()"
      ],
      "lines": [
        "lib/ reads the clock directly in 1 place. OCP\\AppFramework\\Utility\\ITimeFactory, a PSR-20 ClockInterface, gives the same time and can be replaced in a test.",
        "  lib/Controller/ProfileApiController.php:98 new DateTimeImmutable()"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "config-without-lexicon",
      "level": "info",
      "places": [
        "lib/Listener/ProfilePickerReferenceListener.php:40 getValueString()",
        "lib/Reference/ProfilePickerReferenceProvider.php:38 getValueString()"
      ],
      "lines": [
        "The app reads and writes its app config in 2 places and registers no config lexicon, which IRegistrationContext::registerConfigLexicon() takes since Nextcloud 31. A lexicon states the type, the default and the sensitivity of each key in one place.",
        "  lib/Listener/ProfilePickerReferenceListener.php:40 getValueString()",
        "  lib/Reference/ProfilePickerReferenceProvider.php:38 getValueString()"
      ]
    }
